  "body": "Adds the optional Proxima PowerShell module manifest, Vietnamese usage notes, and a focused harness that validates a data-only manifest AST before import. Packet #1285 (Mission #1238), final specification r8/g9; three new product files, 450 added lines.\n\nReviewed H4: `ecd8cee3ea6da6513a37a9b9aa6c9db65472e41c`. Merged normally as `91be484a05ab40adf6573f11ef6ec0264fc9a3aa`; parents `4068b3a2a0087db287ea979eccbd372a7a0938d7` and H4, tree `f20cb1aa78756ae0a0b818c34e8d90f152b06a2f`. [Actual owner human audit approving spec and standards/security](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1294#issuecomment-6731901025), supplemental to the retained independent pre-push Codex review; validated human v2 receipt on control ref. Failed Claude audit remains failed and is not counted as cross-approval.\n\nValidation: Linux selftest1777/1777; strict release184/184; Ruff baseline delta0; focused native PS5.1/7 baseline7RED, candidate7/7, CX12/12 and unchanged S2normal26/26; full original evidence retained. Exact-head PR CI plus admission/Ready checks27/27 successful; K0–K7 and v2 rc0. Windows CI/full Windows mutant CI excluded by owner instruction. No LIVE/runtime activation.\n\nKnown P3 `manifest-requires-guard-comment-regex` is **not fixed**: [exact-H4 owner waiver](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1294#issuecomment-6731269220), separate open debt #1295. Historical whole-class closure does not cover this confirmed finding.\n\nPost-merge: [canonical CI on actual M](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/actions/runs/42564993334) completed successfully:23/23Ubuntu,1777/1777,strict184/184. Full-source AUX14 read all23logs/44563lines and verified97sourcefiles, officialartifact digest, actualGraphQLWD and four derived anchors. Raw not_measured/platformskip limits retained. **Landed and bookkeeping complete:** [M8](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/issues/1285#issuecomment-6733549261), exactpost/readback, g9retired/zeroactiveclaims/finalD1–D4rc0. P3 debt #1295 remains OPEN/notfixed; Mission #1238/P2 remain in progress. Passive archival queue follows ADR0060.",
